<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="heroic-dungeon-gear">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/pvecurrency-valor.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Heroic Dungeon Gear for Holy Priests</span></h2>This list represents the best gear available strictly from Heroic dungeons in Phase 3 of Mists of Pandaria Classic, although it is very important to remember that because other gear may be obtained at a higher item level from raids, crafting, world bosses, etc, it is not a true "best in slot" list, but instead more of a rough guideline and players should sim the gear they actually have available to them in order to determine their best combination of stats and effects.<br/>
<br/>
