<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Holy Priests</span></h2>With the release of phase 3, two new world bosses are available which drop loot equivalent to Normal Throne of Thunder, Oondasta and Nalak. The previous phase world bosses still spawn and drop loot, though at a lower level than the new Celestial Dungeons, and thus are generally only useful for a quick iLvl boost for completely fresh characters.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="nalak">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_pandarenserpentmount_lightning_blue.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Nalak</span></h3>
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=69099/nalak">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Nalak</span></a> is notable in that it drops 522-iLvl Tier 15 legs and gloves as well as various 496-iLvl Tyrannical Gladiator's pieces. This is a great way to get a head start on your tier set if you get lucky.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="oondasta">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ability_hunter_pet_devilsaur.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Oondasta</span></h3>
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=69161/oondasta">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Oondasta</span></a> drops a lot of high level items that you really want to try for every week.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95184/girdle-of-dimorphodontics">
<img alt="Girdle of Dimorphodontics" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cloth_raidpriest_m_01belt.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Girdle of Dimorphodontics</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95193/gloves-of-varsoon-the-greater">
<img alt="Gloves of Varsoon the Greater" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cloth_raidpriest_m_01glove.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gloves of Varsoon the Greater</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95182/robes-of-zalmoxes">
<img alt="Robes of Zalmoxes" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cloth_raidpriest_m_01robe.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robes of Zalmoxes</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95185/terrorful-weave">
<img alt="Terrorful Weave" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_cloth_raidwarlock_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Terrorful Weave</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95183/waistband-of-elder-falcarius">
<img alt="Waistband of Elder Falcarius" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_robe_cloth_raidwarlock_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Waistband of Elder Falcarius</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95177/choker-of-stygimolochy">
<img alt="Choker of Stygimolochy" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_124.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Choker of Stygimolochy</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="sha-of-anger">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/sha_spell_fire_felfirenova.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Sha of Anger</span></h3>Sha of Anger drops 496-iLvl Tier 14 legs and gloves as well as various 483-iLvl Malevolent Gladiator's pieces. With the release of phase 3 these items are much lower value but it can be a good way to head some extra gear when starting a new toon.<br/>
<br/>The first time you kill the Sha of Anger, it will also drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89317/claw-of-anger">
<img alt="Claw of Anger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hand_1h_shaclaw.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Claw of Anger</span></a>. This can be turned in for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90911/furyheart-treads">
<img alt="Furyheart Treads" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Furyheart Treads</span></a>, an early pair of boots.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="galleon">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mushanbeastmount.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Galleon</span></h3>Galleon drops a selection of 496-iLvl items that can help you gear up early on.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
