<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="crafted-gear">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mace_39.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Crafted &amp; Profession Gear for Holy Priests</span></h2>Crafted items are for the most part no longer restricted by profession, meaning that even if you aren't a Tailor, you can equip anything Tailors craft. These are items you can get crafted by a Tailor that knows the appropriate recipes.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=94279/falling-blossom-sandals">
<img alt="Falling Blossom Sandals" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cloth_raidpriest_m_01boot.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Falling Blossom Sandals</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=94280/falling-blossom-hood">
<img alt="Falling Blossom Hood" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cloth_raidpriest_m_01helm.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Falling Blossom Hood</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="trinkets">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/creatureportrait_twilightshammer_dragonegg_01.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Pre-Raid Holy Priest Trinkets</span></h2>There is a wide selection of healer trinkets for this patch but some of them are on the weaker side, these are all relevant trinkets for the phase:<h5 class="heading-size-5" id="best-trinkets">Best Trinkets</h5>You should avoid having two active trinkets at the same time, but besides that feel free to use the best out of whatever options you manage to get your hands on.<br/>
<br/>
<ins>Passive Trinkets</ins>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96561/lightning-imbued-chalice">
<img alt="Lightning-Imbued Chalice" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_mage_runeofpower.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightning-Imbued Chalice</span></a> is a simple passive intellect with smart healing on top makes this trinket one of your best choices for the patch.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96385/horridons-last-gasp">
<img alt="Horridon's Last Gasp" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_eyeofthestorm.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Horridon's Last Gasp</span></a> is a good mana trinket that edges out at higher item levels but before you zone into the raid drops down to being your 3rd best choice.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87163/spirits-of-the-sun">
<img alt="Spirits of the Sun" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_drink_29_sunkissedwine.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spirits of the Sun</span></a>, if you have it on heroic level from the previous phase, is a very good option and beats the new trinkets until you can loot them on heroic as well.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87075/qin-xis-polarizing-seal">
<img alt="Qin-xi's Polarizing Seal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_trinketpanda_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Qin-xi's Polarizing Seal</span></a> similarly, if you already have it on heroic level it is good enough to carry you over until heroic Throne of Thunder trinkets.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96456/inscribed-bag-of-hydra-spawn">
<img alt="Inscribed Bag of Hydra-Spawn" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_creature_poison_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inscribed Bag of Hydra-Spawn</span></a> weaker than your other options and with no passive intellect, Hydra-spawn simply doesn't quite match your other available options.</div></li></ul>
<ins>Active Trinkets</ins>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=94509/soothing-talisman-of-the-shado-pan-assault">
<img alt="Soothing Talisman of the Shado-Pan Assault" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_elemental_primal_life.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Soothing Talisman of the Shado-Pan Assault</span></a> is a really good trinket that is only beaten overall by the fact that other trinkets available in the patch can be acquired at higher item levels.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=96507/stolen-relic-of-zuldazar">
<img alt="Stolen Relic of Zuldazar" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_twilightfireward.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stolen Relic of Zuldazar</span></a> lets you shield an ally, these are very useful for specific situations but overall this trinket isn't very good and its lack of intellect ultimately puts it below over options.</div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="hit-expertise">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ability_marksmanship.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Reaching Hit and Expertise Cap for Holy Priest</span></h2>As a Holy Priest, <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=122098/divine-fury">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_sealofwrath.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Divine Fury</span></a> will take care of all the Hit Rating you might need, which means you don't need to worry about it and should get other stats instead.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="gemming">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_uncut_purple.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Gemming for Holy Priests</span></h2>Gems choices are very simple, and you will want to get all socket bonuses you can.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="q9">Meta Gem</span>: <a class="q5 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95345/courageous-primal-diamond">
<img alt="Courageous Primal Diamond" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_legendary_chimeraoffear.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Courageous Primal Diamond</span></a> or <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76885/burning-primal-diamond">
<img alt="Burning Primal Diamond" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_metagem_cut.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Burning Primal Diamond</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="gem2">Red Gem</span>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76694/brilliant-primordial-ruby">
<img alt="Brilliant Primordial Ruby" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_red.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant Primordial Ruby</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="gem6">Orange Gem</span>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76660/potent-vermilion-onyx">
<img alt="Potent Vermilion Onyx" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_orange.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Potent Vermilion Onyx</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="gem10">Purple Gem</span>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76686/purified-imperial-amethyst">
<img alt="Purified Imperial Amethyst" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_purple.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Purified Imperial Amethyst</span></a></div></li>
<li>
